{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17102340","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17102340","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710234001:1":{"text":"ご夫人、あなたのハンドバッグはこちらですよ。","source_cn":"夫人，您的手袋在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21668EF38E5C56CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710234002:1":{"text":"あぁ、信じられないわ。我がブライト王国の中心地、栄えある王都サバンナに、あんな野蛮な動物が現れるなんて！","source_cn":"哦，真是难以置信——在耀光帝国的中心，王都赛凡纳竟会出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF69E9DBC9ECE158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710234003:1":{"text":"ヘンドリック卿のご令嬢がいてくれて助かったわ。彼女にあれほどのお手並みがあったなんてねぇ！","source_cn":"幸好有亨德里克司令家的格温妮丝在场，没想到她还有这般本事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A08F8365BC742B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710234004:1":{"text":"さすがはグウィネス隊長！惚れ惚れする一撃でした！","source_cn":"刚才格温妮丝队长那一箭！太漂亮了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x572A14A797CA341D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710234005:1":{"text":"人混みがまたざわめきだした。見ると、群衆をかき分けてグウィネスがこちらへやって来る。","source_cn":"人群又开始骚动起来，你发现格温妮丝已经穿过人群，向你们...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDDD22BA666AB2251","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"人混みがまたざわめきだした。見ると、群衆をかき分けてグウィネスがこちらへやって来る。","female":"人混みがまたざわめきだした。見ると、群衆をかき分けてグウィネスがこちらへやって来る。","variant_male_record_index":"228053","variant_female_record_index":"228054","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710234006:1":{"text":"ほ、本物のグウィネスさまよ！かっこいいー！","source_cn":"是……是真的格温妮丝！好酷！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82B7C5A440F35946","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710234007:0":{"text":"カロレイン伯爵。壊れた物や、なくなった物がないか、バッグの中を確認していただけますか？","source_cn":"凯洛伦伯爵。请您清点手袋，确认是否有财物损坏或遗失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E57F3CD65B1E99C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710234008:0":{"text":"中身は無事よ。本当に助かったわ！","source_cn":"一点都没有！真是万幸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4228BB1D124377FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710234009:1":{"text":"グウィネスさんの弓矢の腕前は、本当に素晴らしいのねぇ。","source_cn":"格温妮丝小姐，你的箭术……着实令人惊叹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF24FC16D77C26B4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710234010:1":{"text":"あなたのお父様にも、今日のお礼をお伝えしたいから、近いうちにお屋敷へ伺うわね。","source_cn":"月内我定会择日拜访令尊，亲自表达我的赞赏与感谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06E32F76D3F278E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710234011:1":{"text":"過分なお言葉にございます。守備軍として当然の務めにございますゆえ、父へは、ことさらお伝えいただくには及びません。","source_cn":"夫人，您过誉了。这只是守备军的职责所在，不必特意告知司令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEC6E27A8C09847A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710234012:1":{"text":"コンロ、他にも猿の被害を受けた人がいないか確認してきてください。","source_cn":"孔罗，去检查那只猴子是否还造成了其他损失或有人受伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x113FC09279266569","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710234013:0":{"text":"はっ！","source_cn":"是，队长！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D4FCE5D0298B656","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710234014:1":{"text":"はぁ、祭典の初日にこんな目に遭うなんて、なんだか一気に疲れたわ。","source_cn":"唉，在庆典首日便遭遇这等意外，着实令人心力交瘁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D5A57FD5E0145F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710234015:1":{"text":"カラ、気分が優れないから、屋敷に戻るわ。観兵式には行けないと向こうに伝えてちょうだい。","source_cn":"卡拉，传我的话，就说我略感不适，需回府歇息，不便观看今...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16CCA81FA78E4D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit